    <string name="perm_title">Permissions needed</string>
    <string name="perm_msg">NetPulse needs:\n\n• Location — Android only shares cell tower information with apps that have location access. It is also used for GPS on the map and in drive logs.\n\n• Phone — to read your SIM, operator and network type.\n\nYour data stays on your phone. Nothing is uploaded unless you add an OpenCelliD key (then only the cell ID is sent to find the tower).</string>
